		"These values are hand-written approximations, written to be plausible rather than",
		"accurate, so that the admin screens and the converter can be demonstrated on a site",
		"with no API key. Nothing here was ever returned by freecurrencyapi.com.",
		"",
		"`captured_at` is deliberately in the past and is written to every row's `fetched_at`.",
		"Two things follow from that, both intended: the admin table shows the rates as weeks",
		"old rather than as current, and the freshness window in RateUpdater sees them as",
		"stale, so loading this file never blocks or delays a real sync.",
		"",
		"Where these overlap with tests/Fixtures/latest.json the values agree, so the demo and",
		"the test suite cannot tell different stories about the same currency.",
		"",
		"A real `wp currency rates update` overwrites every row here and clears demo mode."
